# School description content

When composing a description (the user did not paste the exact text):

- Never mention age or uzrast. It is already on the card (`ageLabel`).
- Never mention the place, street, district, or venue. It is already on the address and the map.
- That includes „časovi su na…“, „treninzi se održavaju u…“, „na adresi…“, „od X godina“, „za uzrast…“.
- Write only the program.
